  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00762-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row23Member">（保有目的）原料購入・製品販売取引の維持・強化を図るため保有してきたが、当事業年度の検証の結果を踏まえ、当事業年度中にすべての株式を売却済</jpcrp030000-asr_E00762-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
